OL,3,ATrump says FBI investigating Nvidia
OL,4,Aboss's affair with alleged Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said the FBI is
OL,7,Finvestigating the affair between the
OL,8,Fboss of Nvidia and an alleged Chinese
OL,9,Fspy.
OL,11,FThe US President said he spoke with
OL,12,Fchief executive Jensen Huang on Monday
OL,13,Ffollowing reports that the US believed
OL,14,Fhe had been targeted in a Chinese
OL,15,Fespionage campaign.
OL,17,F"I asked him that question, 'Did you
OL,18,Fhave any idea she was a spy?' He said
OL,19,F'I had no idea she was a spy' and I
OL,20,Freally believe him," Trump told
OL,21,Freporters.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
